U S 0~
sutakl stenchful~
Sutakl the Stenchful~
Sutakl the Stenchful is fowling up the air here.
~
   Humanoid in form, Sutakl is putrid through and through.  Her body seems to
be made of solidified vomit and bile.  Her feet and legs are lightly covered in
burnt hair.  A large skunk's tail, over three feet in length and bushy,
protrudes from her backside.  The pungent odor of feces emanates from smears on
her torso, which help to mask the downright dizzying smell of decaying flesh
that are her arms.  Rotten fish scales flake off of her face and neck,
revealing mossy under-flesh.  Her hair, matted with some tar-like substance
sulfurous, is twenty-some whips of wisps of agony.    
~
