F D 2~
keclutrac krunchy~
Keclutrac the Krunchy~
A humming, buzzing sound eminates from Keclutrac the Krunchy.
~
   Keclutrac isn't really a person, it's more of an entity comprised of
thousands of insects of all varieties clinging together to form one being.  
It's legs seem to be mostly comprised of large ants and spiders.  Scorpions run
up and down the legs.  Keclutrac's arms are a pair of collections of millipedes
and centipedes of many colors.  Having no skeleton, these limbs flow and bend
amorphously around the torso.  Keclutrac's torso is made up mostly of spiders,
black widows and tarantulas mainly.  Several wasps, and yellow jackets and
flies swarm around the torso causing it to not really have a solid surface.  
Keclutrac's head is a swarm of larvae and cockroaches.  It bustles with
activity.  Tiny moths hover all about it.  Two small clusters of lightning bugs
within the head pulse in unison and seem to be Keclutrac's eyes.    
~
