gozuthilki~
Gozuthilki the Ghastly~
Gozuthilki the Ghastly is oozing larva here.
~
Gozuthilki is utterly disgusting.  He is humanoid in shape, but where arms
should be there are 3 snakes each.  They are about four feet long and they do
not have their skin.  Their bloody muscles and bones show.  As these snakes
hiss at you, maggots spew out of their fangs instead of venom.  Gozuthilki's
head is just as heinous.  There is a large hole where his forehead should be.
His eyes seems to be coal and cockroaches spew forth from his mouth as he tries
to speak and his nose flaps in the breeze.  A squirt of blood issues forth from
his chest with every heartbeat, sending a small stream of sulfurous toxins your
way.  His knees seem to bend the wrong way and his femurs are obviously broken,
leaving bone to stick out all over the place.
~
